1
00:01:45,840 --> 00:01:46,640
You're awake.

2
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:48,600
I made you breakfast.

3
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:53,280
Are you crazy?

4
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,210
What do you want?

5
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:55,840
I'm protecting you.

6
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:58,440
Protecting me?

7
00:01:58,600 --> 00:01:59,240
You knocked me out

8
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,480
and brought me to your house.

9
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:02,080
This used to be your home too.

10
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:02,730
Pei Song.

11
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,280
We are already divorced.

12
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:06,240
Today is the day I marry Pei Ning.

13
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:09,639
I've told you many times.

14
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:10,840
I don't know how to explain it.

15
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:11,970
Someone wants to...

16
00:02:12,920 --> 00:02:14,160
This is kidnapping.

17
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:15,360
I can call the police.

18
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:23,160
It's useless to trap me here.

19
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:25,120
The person I love is Pei Ning.

20
00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:26,160
I am going to marry him.

21
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:27,820
You just can't compare to him.

22
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,300
What are you doing?

23
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:32,780
What are you doing?

24
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:36,400
Let go of me.

25
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:37,660
Did you just say

26
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,210
I can't compare to Pei Ning?

27
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:41,210
I can't compare to Pei Ning, right?

28
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,380
Don't touch me.

29
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:51,280
Just stay here and behave.

30
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:58,850
I'll let you go after today.

31
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:21,200
Make do with this.

32
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:22,360
I'm not good at cooking.

33
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:24,040
I only have instant noodles at home.

34
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,770
Pei Song, stop messing around.

35
00:05:25,880 --> 00:05:28,000
Are we playing house or something?

36
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,810
Do you want it spicy?

37
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,200
How much should I add?

38
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:33,340
Is this enough?

39
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:38,000
Give me back my phone.

40
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:40,640
I promise you.

41
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,040
I won't go to the wedding.

42
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:44,380
But I have to call Pei Ning to let him know.

43
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:46,140
I will tell him for you.

44
00:05:46,560 --> 00:05:47,960
Green onions, cilantro.

45
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:51,520
I remember you don't eat green onions.

46
00:05:51,520 --> 00:05:52,720
Give me back my phone.

47
00:05:54,440 --> 00:05:55,440
Give me my phone, car keys,

48
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:56,200
and wallet.

49
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:21,520
Stab me.

50
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:27,120
Let me go.

51
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,560
Put me down.

52
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:30,960
Pei Song.

53
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:32,840
Put me down.

54
00:06:33,400 --> 00:06:34,360
Let me go.

55
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:35,800
Pei Song.

56
