63
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,440
get up and eat something.

64
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:33,360
Shiya.

65
00:08:35,799 --> 00:08:36,520
Shiya,

66
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:37,860
are you asleep?

67
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,480
Get up and eat something.

68
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,200
Shiya.

69
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:42,600
Didn't expect this, did you?

70
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:43,440
Fang Jingyan.

71
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:44,960
Why are you here?

72
00:09:08,520 --> 00:09:09,650
Where is Song Shiya?

73
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:11,160
I let Shiya go.

74
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:12,840
Let her go? Are you crazy?

75
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:14,580
Do you know what you're doing?

76
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:16,280
I'm helping my bestie

77
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:19,010
escape the control of her psychotic ex-husband.

78
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:20,520
I was protecting her.

79
00:09:20,520 --> 00:09:22,980
Someone is trying to kill her at the wedding.

80
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:25,440
I'm so scared.

81
00:09:26,520 --> 00:09:27,000
Fang Jingyan!

82
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,480
Dude, you've watched too many dramas,

83
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:29,920
