90
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:40,760
Fang Jingyan!

91
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:43,960
I don't have time to mess around with you.

92
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:45,280
Tell me where Shiya is.

93
00:09:55,280 --> 00:09:57,340
You hid her in the closet, didn't you?

94
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:58,960
You and Shiya are already divorced.

95
00:09:58,960 --> 00:10:00,000
Stop bothering her.

96
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:01,000
Get out of the way.

97
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:03,760
You'll only make Shiya hate you more by doing this.

98
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:05,040
I'll tell you one last time.

99
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:06,170
I am protecting her.

100
